                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a HW clock in the Ethernet Controller.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Please note: It is recommended to always use the same hardware clock tree of the used platform for Ethernet hardware clocks which refer to the same EthClkUnit, otherwise cross-timestamping is needed.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
